+/// Byte-exact correctness oracle for **multi-asset reconstruction** against a
+/// REAL preprod `tables` MemPack blob (the #10 MultiAssetNotConserved /
+/// `input_side:0` bug). This is the anti-no-op proof that the green synthetic
+/// `parse_multi_asset_rep` unit test is NOT sufficient: it decodes the multi-asset
+/// `tag-0`/`tag-1` `CompactValue` straight from the on-disk TxOut envelope (the
+/// path the importer takes) and asserts the recovered `(PolicyID, AssetName, Qty)`
